# ── CHLOE AI — local data that must never be published ──────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# Only source, the bundled icon and the safe example belong in config/.
# Keep comments on separate lines: Git does not support inline comments here.
/config/*
!/config/__init__.py
!/config/jarvis.ico
!/config/api_keys.example.json
# Explicit rules also protect nested copies and exported credentials.
**/api_keys.json
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/*.json
memory/*.jsonl
memory/*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
node_modules/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk
*.local
*.bak
*.tmp
*~

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
uploads/
recordings/
backups/
.jarvis_profiles/
.playwright/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Protect nested personal data and certificate copies.
/memory/*
!/memory/*.py
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.p7b
*.p7c
*.jks
*.db
*.jsonl
